<!--meta {"lead": "An empty state fills a region that has nothing to show yet, nothing that matches, or nothing it could load, and gives the person one clear next step.", "description": "First-run, no-results, error, permission and success variants, full and compact.", "pills": ["Status: stable", "Icon + title + one sentence + one action"], "variants": "first-run, no results, error, permission, success; full and compact", "states": "default, action focused, retrying (busy)", "sources": ["pages/my-appointments/empty", "pages/style-gallery/no-results", "pages/style-gallery/error", "pages/booking-request/success"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use an empty state when a list, gallery or panel has no items to render. It always has four parts: an icon in a tinted circle, a title that says what is (or is not) here, one sentence that explains why or what happens next, and one primary action that moves the person forward.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>First-run</b>: nothing exists yet ("No appointments yet"). Point to how things get here.</li>
    <li><b>No results</b>: search or filters excluded everything. Offer to widen or clear them.</li>
    <li><b>Error</b>: the content could not load. Say the person's work is safe and offer "Try again".</li>
    <li><b>Permission</b>: the content exists but this account cannot see it. Offer to sign in with the right account.</li>
    <li><b>Success</b>: a form's job is done (request sent, review posted). The region becomes a confirmation with the next step.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Full-page errors inside the shell (404, 403, 500, offline) are documented as <a href="error-page.html">Error page</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy">
    <figure class="ds-anatomy__figure">
      <section class="empty">
        <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:calendar|icon--lg}}</div>
        <p class="empty__title">No appointments yet</p>
        <p class="empty__text">When you request a visit, you’ll find its status and details here.</p>
        <div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div>
      </section>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 30%; top: 14%;" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 42%;" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 60%;" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 82%;" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    </figure>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Icon</b><small>64px circle (48px compact), tinted by variant; a 24px SVG icon, <code>aria-hidden</code>.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Title</b><small><code>--text-h3</code>, 28px from 768px; a real heading at the right level for the region.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Text</b><small>One sentence, <code>--color-fg-muted</code>, capped at 36ch.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Actions</b><small>One primary button; an optional secondary button or link.</small></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  <p>The variant sets the icon tint and the copy formula; the layout never changes. (Examples here use <code>&lt;p class="empty__title"&gt;</code> to keep this page's outline; production uses a heading.)</p>
  {{example:[stack]First-run (accent), no results (accent), error (danger), permission (warning), success (accent with check).}}
<section class="empty">
  <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:calendar|icon--lg}}</div>
  <p class="empty__title">No appointments yet</p>
  <p class="empty__text">When you request a visit, you’ll find its status and details here.</p>
  <div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div>
</section>
<section class="empty">
  <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search|icon--lg}}</div>
  <p class="empty__title">No matches for these filters</p>
  <p class="empty__text">Try a wider price range or distance to see more options.</p>
  <div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button">Clear filters</button></div>
</section>
<section class="empty empty--error">
  <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle|icon--lg}}</div>
  <p class="empty__title">We couldn’t load the style gallery</p>
  <p class="empty__text">Check your connection and try again. Your details are safe.</p>
  <div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button">Try again</button><a class="btn" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div>
</section>
<section class="empty empty--warning">
  <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:lock|icon--lg}}</div>
  <p class="empty__title">This appointment belongs to another account</p>
  <p class="empty__text">Sign in with the account used for this appointment.</p>
  <div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/sign-in/default.html">Sign in</a></div>
</section>
<section class="empty">
  <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:check|icon--lg}}</div>
  <p class="empty__title">Request sent to Nia</p>
  <p class="empty__text">This is a request, not a confirmed appointment. Nia will reply with the final time and price.</p>
  <div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/appointment-detail/default.html">View appointment</a></div>
</section>
  {{/example}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes"><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2>
  <p>Full is for a page's main region or a whole gallery. Compact is for a card, a panel in the detail grid, or a dialog body.</p>
  {{example:[start]Full: 48px block padding, 64px icon. Compact (<code>.empty--compact</code>): 32px padding, 48px icon.}}
<div class="card" style="flex: 1 1 18rem;">
  <section class="empty">
    <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:star|icon--lg}}</div>
    <p class="empty__title">No reviews yet</p>
    <p class="empty__text">Nia’s first reviews will appear here after her next appointments.</p>
  </section>
</div>
<div class="card" style="flex: 1 1 18rem;">
  <section class="empty empty--compact">
    <div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:star}}</div>
    <p class="empty__title">No reviews yet</p>
    <p class="empty__text">Nia’s first reviews will appear here after her next appointments.</p>
  </section>
</div>
  {{/example}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <p>The empty state itself is static; its states are its actions'. The buttons follow <a href="button.html">Button</a>, so hover, focus, active and loading come from there.</p>
  <div class="ds-matrix"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Variant</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">Action focused</th><th scope="col">Retrying</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Error</th>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">Reviews didn’t load</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">Reviews didn’t load</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" data-state="focus">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact" aria-busy="true"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">Reviews didn’t load</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" aria-busy="true">Try again</button></div></section></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">No results</th>
        <td><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">No matches</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Clear filters</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">No matches</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" data-state="focus">Clear filters</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--compact" aria-busy="true"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">No matches</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" aria-busy="true">Clear filters</button></div></section></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h3>Both themes</h3>
  {{themes:stack}}<section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:calendar}}</div><p class="empty__title">No appointments yet</p><p class="empty__text">When you request a visit, you’ll find its status and details here.</p></section><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">We couldn’t load your appointments</p><p class="empty__text">Check your connection and try again. Your details are safe.</p></section><section class="empty empty--warning empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:lock}}</div><p class="empty__title">You can’t open this page</p></section>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Centred at every width. The title grows from 22px to 28px at 768px; the text stays capped at 36ch so it never runs the full card width.</li>
    <li>Actions wrap and centre; on phones a single primary action may be full width when the empty state fills the screen.</li>
    <li>Below 640px, use the compact size inside cards and dialogs so the action stays above the fold.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>The icon circle reads <code>--empty-icon-bg</code> and <code>--empty-icon-fg</code>, which the variants map to the accent, danger or warning tokens. In the dark theme those become deep tints (plum 950, red 950, amber 950) with light icons, so the circle reads as part of the surface rather than a bright spot.</p>
  <pre><code>/* A success variant with the success tint */
.empty--success .empty__icon { --empty-icon-bg: var(--color-success-bg); --empty-icon-fg: var(--color-success-icon); }</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3>
  <p>A plain <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> with a real heading at the right level for its region (<code>h2</code> in a page's main area). No ARIA role is needed for first-run and no-results. When an empty or error state replaces content after a search or retry, announce it once: put the title text in a polite <code>role="status"</code> region ("No matches for these filters"), or use <code>role="alert"</code> only when an action the person took failed.</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3>
  <table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>The icon, title and text are not focusable; Tab reaches the primary action, then the secondary.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Activate the action (buttons) or follow it (links, Enter only).</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3>
  <p>Do not move focus to an empty state that appears on page load. After a failed retry or a filter change that empties the list, keep focus on the control the person used. On a success state that replaces a form, move focus to the empty-state title (<code>tabindex="-1"</code>) so the confirmation is read.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3>
  <p>The icon is decorative (<code>aria-hidden</code>); the title carries the meaning. Never rely on the tint: "We couldn’t load…" says it is an error.</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Title on page|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}
    {{pair:Text on page|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}
    {{pair:Text on card|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Icon on accent tint|--color-fg-accent|--color-accent-subtle|3}}
    {{pair:Icon on danger tint|--color-danger-icon|--color-danger-bg|3}}
    {{pair:Icon on warning tint|--color-warning-icon|--color-warning-bg|3}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3>
  <p>None. An empty state appears in place, without entrance animation, so it never delays the action.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3>
  <p>Actions are medium buttons (40px) or larger; two actions keep 12px between them.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Title</b> names the specific thing: "No appointments yet", "No matches for these filters", "We couldn’t load the style gallery". Never a generic "Nothing here yet".</li>
    <li><b>Text</b> is one sentence: why it is empty or what happens next. Errors say what is safe: "Your details are safe."</li>
    <li><b>Action</b> is the next step as a verb phrase: "Explore styles", "Clear filters", "Try again", "Sign in".</li>
    <li>Use the cast: "Nia’s first reviews will appear here…", not "This braider has no reviews."</li>
    <li>Success is a request, not a booking, until the braider accepts: "Request sent to Nia", never "Appointment booked".</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:calendar}}</div><p class="empty__title">No appointments yet</p><p class="empty__text">When you request a visit, you’ll find its status and details here.</p></section></div><figcaption>A title that names the thing, and an SVG icon that matches it.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><p class="empty__title">Nothing here yet</p><p class="empty__text">There’s no information to show here yet.</p></section></div><figcaption>The mocks use "Nothing here yet" and a ✦ glyph on every empty screen; neither says what is missing.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:star}}</div><p class="empty__title">No portfolio photos yet</p><p class="empty__text">You can still read Nia’s services and policies.</p><div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="../../mocks/pages/booking-request/default.html">Request with Nia</a></div></section></div><figcaption>The action continues the task on this screen.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:star}}</div><p class="empty__title">No portfolio photos yet</p><div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div></section></div><figcaption>The empty braider profile mock sends people away with "Explore styles" when they came to book Nia.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {{tok:Icon circle (default)|--color-accent-subtle|--color-fg-accent}}
      {{tok:Icon circle (error)|--color-danger-bg|--color-danger-icon}}
      {{tok:Icon circle (permission)|--color-warning-bg|--color-warning-icon}}
      {{tok:Title|--color-fg-default}}
      {{tok:Text|--color-fg-muted}}
      {{tok:Title font|--text-h3|--font-size-2xl}}
      {{tok:Padding full / compact|--space-12|--space-8}}
      {{tok:Gap between parts|--space-3}}
      {{tok:Icon circle radius|--radius-full}}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;section class="empty empty--error"&gt;
  &lt;div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg class="icon icon--lg" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;…&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;h2 class="empty__title"&gt;We couldn’t load the style gallery&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p class="empty__text"&gt;Check your connection and try again. Your details are safe.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;div class="empty__actions"&gt;
    &lt;button class="btn btn--primary" type="button"&gt;Try again&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;a class="btn" href="/"&gt;Explore styles&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre>
  <table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Class / attribute</th><th scope="col">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><code>.empty</code></td><td>Centred column, full padding.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty--compact</code></td><td>Less padding, 48px icon; for cards, panels and dialogs.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty--error</code> <code>.empty--warning</code></td><td>Danger or warning icon tint.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty__icon</code>, <code>.empty__title</code>, <code>.empty__text</code>, <code>.empty__actions</code></td><td>The four parts; the title is a heading in production.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty__reference</code></td><td>Monospace reference id for support (error pages).</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>role="status"</code></td><td>Optional; announces an empty state that replaces content after an action.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
  <p>Extracted from these mocks:</p>
  <ul>
    {{mock:pages/my-appointments/empty|first-run}}
    {{mock:pages/notification-center/empty|first-run}}
    {{mock:pages/braider-profile/empty|first-run in a detail page}}
    {{mock:pages/style-gallery/no-results|no results with a filter badge}}
    {{mock:pages/my-appointments/no-results|no results}}
    {{mock:pages/style-gallery/error|error with retry}}
    {{mock:pages/booking-request/success|success replaces the form}}
    {{mock:pages/forbidden/default|permission}}
  </ul>
  <p>Drift fixed during extraction: icons were text glyphs (✦, !, ⌕, ✓) that some screen readers announce (now SVG icons, <code>aria-hidden</code>); every first-run screen used the same title "Nothing here yet" (now a specific title per screen); the empty braider profile offered "Explore styles" instead of continuing to book; the empty title used the 36px light <code>h2</code> role (now <code>--text-h3</code>, 28px from 768px); success states reused <code>.empty</code> with a ✓ glyph (kept as the success variant, with a check icon and focus moved to the title).</p>
</section>
